  "details": "You can not read the whole message of the invite notification on the Invites tab of the Notification view (not in-game) of Android Mobile.\n\nSee the attached image. It only shows 24 characters at best and 6 characters at worst (if attaching an image and using Japanese characters) in this case. Also, it lacks the height on each field.\n\nTapping on each message shows the sender's profile. Instead, I prefer that tapping on the text shows the message in a large popup like the Group post notifications, leaving behavior showing the profile by tapping the sender's user icon.\n\nAlthough you can see them in the in-game notification view of MM, this issue decreases the usefulness of the recently introduced Offline Invites feature.",
